          "statement": "For an integer $d\\ge1$, let $\\mathbb S^d$ be the real symmetric $d\\times d$ matrices and let $\\mathbb S_+^d=\\{M\\in\\mathbb S^d:v^TMv\\ge0\\text{ for every }v\\in\\mathbb R^d\\}$. With the Frobenius norm $\\|A\\|_F=(\\sum_{i,j}A_{ij}^2)^{1/2}$, the set $\\mathbb S_+^d$ is closed in $\\mathbb S^d$."
        },
